    <JobName.mechanic_arcane>机关术士</JobName.mechanic_arcane>
    <JobDescription.mechanic_arcane>以机关与魔法守护潜艇的机修工。沿用机修工底树，并拥有机关术士分支。</JobDescription.mechanic_arcane>
    <JobName.mechanic_mystic>破碎工匠</JobName.mechanic_mystic>
    <JobDescription.mechanic_mystic>以残缺与伤痛换取战力的机修工。沿用机修工底树，并拥有破碎工匠分支。</JobDescription.mechanic_mystic>
